# rtmux LKL config overlay for the lkl-fsd personality: filesystem/block only,
# no network stack.  Applied on top of configs/lkl-rtmux.config by
# scripts/build-lkl-rv64.sh --build-from-source when LKL_PERSONALITY=fsd, which
# also drops net.o and virtio_net.o from the archive.
#
# Measured: dropping the net stack cuts the kernel blob ~1.16 MB text + ~0.3 MB
# data versus the combined archive, with fs/block behaviour unchanged.
# CONFIG_NET is not set
